{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-2-2-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_2_2_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2-n-2-2-1:001\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本研究药物研发代号为合成药E1。产品身份应可回溯至当前产品权威来源，且不得以历史或未版本化资料替代当前权威来源。【待补充：当前产品权威来源的版本与定位：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2-n-2-2-1:002\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本章应说明研究药物的剂型、规格、理化性质等适用特征，并针对化学结构/分子式给出适用性结论及理由；在适用性结论确认前，不应默认套用结构式描述。【待补充：研究药物的剂型、规格、理化性质等适用特征：该项待研究团队确认后补充】【待补充：化学结构/分子式的适用性结论及理由：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2-n-2-2-1:003\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本药作用机制段为继承性义务，属于本章基于已有研究背景所作的声明式实质补充；现有来源材料未提供可直接引用的机制表述，不得反向引用未含机制表述的来源作为已含证据。本章应说明研究药物的作用机制并标明证据来源。【待补充：研究药物的作用机制及其证据来源：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"c4e8d12b9cf7d025db2219e7d4ff363ecd332cf43e366cd3c6c5bbb82a56dcba"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:6ab4bd6060ae4e9f480bcb48f405893e2c302b9cc538bc544ba9bf7023cda54f:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:6ab4bd6060ae4e9f480bcb48f405893e2c302b9cc538bc544ba9bf7023cda54f:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-latest-cloud","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"cfe5ade291d05fba2121629e8238f78f3cb0ab77404162918145c4450bb2506b","prompt_sha256":"5322c0235bbedc2213b004747cbd757992154e907fd360b9bf7be0e09db8863e","provider_session_id":"e77cafd9-5a58-4720-bc02-b955fea2ae92","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_re